      "Pellwall.com (dilution practice)",
      "Mandy Aftel, Essence & Alchemy (amber triangle)",
      "Poucher, Perfumes Cosmetics and Soaps Vol. II (secondary)",
      "Calkin & Jellinek, Perfumery: Practice and Principles",
      "Basenotes / Reddit r/DIYfragrance (community, flagged approx)"
    ],
    "proportion_note": "proportion is a relative weight (parts). For a role using a pre-dilution, an added 'dilution' field gives the solution strength; the proportion refers to that diluted material unless noted."
